title: Hub
---
허브. #line:h001
-> 도서관 #line:h002
    <<jump Library>>
-> 항구 <<if visited("Library")>> #line:h003
    <<jump Harbor>>
-> 떠난다 #line:h004
    안녕. #line:h005
허브 끝. #line:h006
===

title: Library
---
조용한 도서관. #line:l001
<<jump Hub>>
