title: Harbor
---
항구. #line:p001
<<if visited("Library") and visited("Harbor")>>
    둘 다 방문. #line:p002
<<endif>>
<<if visited_count("Hub") >= 2>>
    허브 재방문. #line:p003
<<endif>>
